  "question": {
    "text": "The curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in the first quadrant is such that the <math><mi>y</mi></math> -intercept of the tangent drawn at any point <math><mi>P</mi></math> is equal to twice the ordinate of <math><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> passes through <math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then the equation of the curve is",
